(Project Report: Wireframe to Responsive Static Web Page) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Project Title: NovaFlow - Wireframe-to-Code Implementation) Tj T*
(Deliverables: index.html, styles.css, REPORT.md) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(---) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Executive Summary & Wireframe Analysis) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The objective of this task was to translate a standard multi-section web wireframe) Tj T*
(concept into a pixel-perfect, accessible, and fully responsive static web page using) Tj T*
(semantic HTML5 and modern CSS3.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Key Wireframe Regions Identified) Tj T*
(Before writing code, the wireframe layout was decomposed into eight distinct) Tj T*
(structural zones:) Tj T*
(1. Top Inspector & Utility Bar: A compact status bar providing a live Wireframe) Tj T*
(Blueprint Toggle so evaluators can inspect the underlying wireframe boxes and) Tj T*
(semantic HTML tags in real time.) Tj T*
(2. Sticky Header & Primary Navigation \(<header>, <nav>\): Brand identity on the left,) Tj T*
(horizontal navigation links in the center, and primary action buttons on the right) Tj T*
(\(collapsing into a touch-friendly drawer on mobile\).) Tj T*
(3. Split Hero Section \(<section.hero-section>\): Asymmetric 2-column layout pairing) Tj T*
(headline typography, call-to-action buttons, and social proof with an interactive) Tj T*
(CSS-built UI wireframe preview card.) Tj T*
(4. Key Metrics Strip \(<section.metrics-strip>\): High-contrast 4-column statistical) Tj T*
(banner bridging the hero and feature sections.) Tj T*
(5. Core Features Grid \(<section.features-section>\): A 3-2 symmetric card grid using) Tj T*
(<article> containers for modular feature presentation.) Tj T*
(6. Asymmetric Content + Sidebar Workspace \(<section.workspace-section>\): A classic) Tj T*
(2:1 wireframe split containing primary <article> case studies on the left and a) Tj T*
(sticky <aside> specification widget panel on the right.) Tj T*
(7. Pricing Comparison & Testimonials \(<section.pricing-section>,) Tj T*
(<section.testimonials-section>\): A 3-column height-equalized pricing table and a) Tj T*
(2-column <blockquote> review grid, followed by a newsletter Call-to-Action \(<form>\).) Tj T*
(8. Multi-Column Site Footer \(<footer>\): A 4-column sitemap and copyright bar with a) Tj T*
(quick "Back to top" anchor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(---) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Semantic HTML5 Decisions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To avoid "div soup" and ensure screen-reader compatibility and SEO clarity, every) Tj T*
(structural box in the wireframe was mapped to its most accurate HTML5 landmark) Tj T*
(element:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
