(Main Menu  <nav aria-label="Primary Navigation">  Provides direct landmark navigation) Tj T*
(for assistive technologies.) Tj T*
(Primary Page Content  <main id="main-content">  Paired with a .skip-link \(Skip to) Tj T*
(main content\) for keyboard-only users.) Tj T*
(Thematic Groupings  <section aria-labelledby="...">  Groups related content blocks) Tj T*
(and links each region to its <h2> heading.) Tj T*
(Independent Cards  <article>  Used for feature cards, workspace case studies, and) Tj T*
(pricing tiers.) Tj T*
(Contextual Sidebar  <aside>  Houses supplementary design tokens and interactive tips) Tj T*
(alongside the main workspace feed.) Tj T*
(Customer Quotes  <blockquote> + <cite>  Properly attributes mentor testimonials) Tj T*
(semantically.) Tj T*
(Sitemap & Legal  <footer>  Closes the document hierarchy with structured navigation) Tj T*
(lists.) Tj T*
