(3. CSS Architecture & Layout Strategies) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The stylesheet \(styles.css\) is organized into 13 modular sections using BEM-inspired) Tj T*
(naming conventions \(.block__element--modifier\) and centralized CSS Custom Properties) Tj T*
(\(:root Design Tokens\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 When to Use CSS Grid vs. Flexbox) Tj T*
(A deliberate dual-layout strategy was employed across the page:) Tj T*
(- CSS Grid \(2D Macro Layouts\): Used where control over both rows and columns was) Tj T*
(required simultaneously:) Tj T*
(- .hero-grid: grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr for proportional desktop balance.) Tj T*
(- .features-grid & .pricing-grid: repeat\(3, 1fr\) for strict equal-width column) Tj T*
(tracks.) Tj T*
(- .workspace-layout: grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr to achieve the classic 66% / 33%) Tj T*
(main-content-to-sidebar wireframe ratio.) Tj T*
(- Flexbox \(1D Micro Components\): Used for linear distribution and internal alignment:) Tj T*
(- .header-container & .site-nav: Horizontal alignment with justify-content:) Tj T*
(space-between.) Tj T*
(- .feature-card & .pricing-card: flex-direction: column with flex: 1 on the body list) Tj T*
(so that footer links and CTA buttons remain pinned to the exact same bottom baseline) Tj T*
(across cards with varying text lengths.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 Design System Tokens & 8pt Spatial Grid) Tj T*
(All colors, spacing values, shadows, and border radii are defined in :root:) Tj T*
(- Color Palette: High-contrast Slate ink \(0F172A\) on a soft cool canvas \(F8FAFC\),) Tj T*
(paired with Primary Indigo \(4F46E5\) and Sky Accent \(0EA5E9\), exceeding WCAG AA) Tj T*
ET
