(4. Responsiveness & Media Query Strategy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rather than designing for fixed device models, breakpoints were chosen based on where) Tj T*
(the layout naturally needed to reflow:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Desktop Default \(> 1024px\): Full 1200px container, 3-column feature/pricing grids,) Tj T*
(4-column metrics strip, and 2:1 asymmetric workspace with a position: sticky sidebar.) Tj T*
(2. Tablet Landscape \(@media \(max-width: 1024px\)\):) Tj T*
(- The 2-column Hero stacks vertically and centers its text and CTAs.) Tj T*
(- 3-column grids \(.features-grid, .pricing-grid\) reflow into 2 columns.) Tj T*
(- The <aside> sidebar unsticks and transitions into a 2-column side-by-side widget) Tj T*
(row below the main articles.) Tj T*
(3. Tablet Portrait & Large Mobile \(@media \(max-width: 768px\)\):) Tj T*
(- Pure-CSS Mobile Navigation: The horizontal menu converts into a collapsible) Tj T*
(hamburger drawer using the :checked sibling selector \(.nav-toggle:checked ~) Tj T*
(.site-nav\).) Tj T*
(- Feature, pricing, and testimonial grids collapse to a single readable column \(1fr\).) Tj T*
(- Metrics strip transitions from 4 columns to a 2-2 grid.) Tj T*
(4. Small Mobile Handsets \(@media \(max-width: 480px\)\):) Tj T*
(- CTA button groups stack vertically at width: 100% for comfortable thumb tapping.) Tj T*
(- Data tables wrap inside .breakpoint-table-wrapper \(overflow-x: auto\) to prevent) Tj T*
(horizontal page overflow.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(---) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Challenges Encountered & Creative Solutions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Challenge 1: Equalizing Card Heights with Uneven Content) Tj T*
(- Problem: In the 3-column Features and Pricing sections, cards had different numbers) Tj T*
(of bullet points and text lengths, causing the bottom CTA buttons to look staggered) Tj T*
(and misaligned compared to the wireframe.) Tj T*
(- Solution: Combined CSS Grid on the parent container \(align-items: stretch\) with) Tj T*
(Flexbox on each child card \(display: flex; flex-direction: column\). Setting flex: 1) Tj T*
(on the description/feature-list element forced it to absorb all remaining vertical) Tj T*
(space, locking every card's CTA button to the bottom border.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Challenge 2: Building a Responsive Mobile Menu & Wireframe Inspector Without Heavy) Tj T*
(JavaScript) Tj T*
(- Problem: Static HTML/CSS tasks should not rely on external JS frameworks for basic) Tj T*
ET
